{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_hammerguard","model_identifier":"dwarf_hammerguard","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_hammerguard\n\nDwarf hammerguard (A4), heavy infantry, 1.3 m = 46 u (crest to 50).\n\nDwarf in full heavy armour (riveted breastplate with a deep-red and brass chest panel, mail, pauldrons, tassets, greaves, gauntlets, crested helmet) with a two-handed war hammer: a big square steel head with a back spike on a 40 u leather-wrapped haft. Smashes shields and walls.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -15.0..15.0, y 0.0..48.8, z -6.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 24 x 50 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- smash reach: hammer head lands about 30 u in front\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2 | loop | hammer across the body, head high (loop) |\n| `smash` | 1.4 | once | key 0.72 s: hammer head strikes in front (vertical overhead arc; use it against walls too) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | hammer resting on the right shoulder (also in walk and run) |\n| `walk` | 0.82 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 0.82 s (heavy, rolling)\n- `run`: 85.3 u/s (2.40 m/s), cycle 0.58 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `smash`: key 0.72 s: hammer head strikes in front (vertical overhead arc; use it against walls too)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `war_hammer` (visible, under slot_hand_r): haft 47 u, grip at the origin 6 u from the butt, head 7 x 7.5 x 8 u, face down (-Y), spike up\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- war_hammer: second grip (left hand) 12 u along the haft forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_grey.png`: grey beard\n"},"description":"# dwarf_hammerguard\n\nDwarf hammerguard (A4), heavy infantry, 1.3 m = 46 u (crest to 50).\n\nDwarf in full heavy armour (riveted breastplate with a deep-red and brass chest panel, mail, pauldrons, tassets, greaves, gauntlets, crested helmet) with a two-handed war hammer: a big square steel head with a back spike on a 40 u leather-wrapped haft. Smashes shields and walls.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -15.0..15.0, y 0.0..48.8, z -6.0..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 24 x 50 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- smash reach: hammer head lands about 30 u in front\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2 | loop | hammer across the body, head high (loop) |\n| `smash` | 1.4 | once | key 0.72 s: hammer head strikes in front (vertical overhead arc; use it against walls too) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | hammer resting on the right shoulder (also in walk and run) |\n| `walk` | 0.82 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.58 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 0.82 s (heavy, rolling)\n- `run`: 85.3 u/s (2.40 m/s), cycle 0.58 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `smash`: key 0.72 s: hammer head strikes in front (vertical overhead arc; use it against walls too)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `war_hammer` (visible, under slot_hand_r): haft 47 u, grip at the origin 6 u from the butt, head 7 x 7.5 x 8 u, face down (-Y), spike up\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- war_hammer: second grip (left hand) 12 u along the haft forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_hammerguard_grey.png`: grey beard\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,21.0,-4.5],"to":[7.0,24.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[66,80,80.0,83.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[94,80,103.0,83.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[80,80,94.0,83.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[103,80,112.0,83.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[18,40,32.0,49.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[32,40,46.0,49.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d90c3